1
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:22,560
I should have sent him away earlier.

2
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:21,440
Lan Kexing girl,

3
00:01:27,800 --> 00:01:29,360
what happened to you to end up like this?

4
00:01:31,040 --> 00:01:32,200
Who is she?

5
00:01:32,880 --> 00:01:34,160
She’s Hao Ruichi’s sister.

6
00:01:34,560 --> 00:01:35,360
Hao Piaoliang.

7
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:36,280
Sister,

8
00:01:41,880 --> 00:01:42,760
it seems my brother coming to Earth wasn’t a wasted trip after all.

9
00:01:42,840 --> 00:01:44,360
This trip to Earth Star was not in vain.

10
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:46,040
Star Girl,

11
00:01:46,240 --> 00:01:47,360
please save Hao Ruichi!

12
00:01:47,600 --> 00:01:49,520
He looks like he can’t make it.

13
00:01:51,080 --> 00:01:52,240
I really can’t stand

14
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:53,760
this touching tragic drama of yours.

15
00:01:54,880 --> 00:01:55,640
Don’t worry,

16
00:01:55,760 --> 00:01:56,600
he won’t die.

17
00:02:10,320 --> 00:02:11,080
Hao Ruichi.

18
00:02:11,200 --> 00:02:11,960
Hao Ruichi!

19
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:13,920
Qi Miao.

20
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:24,720
Long time no see.

21
00:02:28,320 --> 00:02:29,240
Sister,

22
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:39,680
how are you feeling now?

23
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:41,000
I’m fine.

24
00:02:42,040 --> 00:02:43,320
But no more crying in the future.

25
00:02:43,400 --> 00:02:44,400
It makes you less adorable.

26
00:02:44,880 --> 00:02:45,520
Idiot.

27
00:02:46,080 --> 00:02:47,280
You scared me to death just now!

28
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:51,280
I told you,

29
00:02:52,240 --> 00:02:53,320
I’ll always be with you.

30
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:04,200
Kiss her!

31
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:05,360
Hurry up, kiss her!

32
00:03:07,920 --> 00:03:08,400
Uh,

33
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:10,720
I’m going to make some goji berry porridge.

34
00:03:11,200 --> 00:03:12,080
You guys keep talking.

35
00:03:15,760 --> 00:03:17,080
Seriously, she’s so silly,

36
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:18,480
but so cute.

37
00:03:18,760 --> 00:03:19,560
She’s really clever.

38
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:20,960
What are you here for?

39
00:03:21,160 --> 00:03:21,800
What,

40
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:23,400
not happy to see your sister?

41
00:03:24,200 --> 00:03:25,080
Well, now you’ve seen me,

42
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:25,760
so go back.

43
00:03:26,600 --> 00:03:28,240
I just saved your life,

44
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:29,720
and that’s how you talk to me?

45
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:31,640
Not cute at all.

46
00:03:32,720 --> 00:03:33,480
So...

47
00:03:34,480 --> 00:03:35,560
Are you here to take me back?

48
00:03:36,320 --> 00:03:37,560
I know you're not willing to.

49
00:03:38,040 --> 00:03:39,840
But I can take you away anytime now.

50
00:03:40,280 --> 00:03:41,920
After all, you can't beat me right now.

51
00:03:48,480 --> 00:03:49,480
Just kidding with you.

52
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:50,040
So?

53
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:50,960
Did I scare you?

54
00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:54,880
Don't worry.

55
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:56,680
Since you have a reason to stay,

56
00:03:56,760 --> 00:03:58,000
I can grant you some time off.

57
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:02,040
However,

58
00:04:03,440 --> 00:04:04,520
your time is limited.

59
00:04:13,200 --> 00:04:14,080
You're so beautiful.

60
00:04:18,400 --> 00:04:19,240
Don't misunderstand.

61
00:04:19,840 --> 00:04:21,000
I was just calling your name.

62
00:04:21,480 --> 00:04:23,080
My name is Qi Dongdong.

63
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:24,480
Nice to meet you.

64
00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:39,720
This planet

65
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:41,640
is quite interesting.

66
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:42,600
Actually,

67
00:04:43,400 --> 00:04:44,800
I’m pretty interesting myself.

68
00:04:46,440 --> 00:04:47,280
First time here, right?

69
00:04:47,440 --> 00:04:48,320
Allow me to introduce it a bit.

70
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:50,520
Here,

71
00:04:50,880 --> 00:04:51,320
take a look.

72
00:04:51,960 --> 00:04:53,120
This is called an air conditioner.

73
00:04:53,520 --> 00:04:55,680
Just press this button,

74
00:04:58,320 --> 00:05:00,760
and cool air will blow out.

75
00:05:03,280 --> 00:05:04,240
This is a television.

76
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:05,360
It allows you to watch

77
00:05:05,440 --> 00:05:07,280
all kinds of stories about our planet.

78
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:11,640
If you have time,

79
00:05:12,800 --> 00:05:14,560
I can join you to check it out.

80
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:18,000
You're quite interesting.

81
00:05:19,880 --> 00:05:21,400
My irresistible charm again.

82
00:05:23,280 --> 00:05:23,760
Beautiful.

83
00:05:24,360 --> 00:05:25,760
Let me show you the other rooms.

84
00:05:26,760 --> 00:05:28,360
You’re not calling me 'sis' even though you're younger.

85
00:05:28,400 --> 00:05:30,480
You're quite bold, huh?

86
00:05:31,760 --> 00:05:33,120
Since Hao Ruichi is fine now,

87
00:05:33,520 --> 00:05:34,320
let’s head back.

88
00:05:38,400 --> 00:05:39,840
Why are you leaving in such a hurry?

89
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:41,760
I was planning to cook something nice for them.

90
00:05:41,880 --> 00:05:44,120
The Goddess wouldn’t come here for no reason this time.

91
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:44,960
If we don't leave now,

92
00:05:45,080 --> 00:05:46,760
there's a chance she might take us back to Lanke Star anytime.

93
00:05:47,400 --> 00:05:49,240
But I think she seems pretty nice.

94
00:05:49,360 --> 00:05:50,960
Don't be fooled by her appearance.

95
00:05:51,960 --> 00:05:55,360
She is the scariest woman on our Blue Ke Star.

96
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:57,840
What do you mean?

97
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:59,520
You said she wants to take Hao Ruichi away?

98
00:06:01,080 --> 00:06:01,600
No way.

99
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:04,080
Hao Ruichi just got his life back, and now he's going to be taken away again?

100
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:05,640
What about Miaomiao?

101
00:06:07,400 --> 00:06:10,120
Now they'll have to figure out something on their own.

102
00:06:20,200 --> 00:06:20,920
Don't worry.

103
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:22,400
As long as I'm here, he won't die.

104
00:06:25,640 --> 00:06:26,360
Pretty Sis.

105
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:28,160
Why aren't you asleep yet?

106
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:29,920
I was about to sleep.

107
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:32,760
But your Earth star's food is too delicious.

108
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:34,480
Now I'm hungry again.

109
00:06:34,640 --> 00:06:36,640
How about I make you something to eat?

110
00:06:36,840 --> 00:06:37,680
Yes, please!

111
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:40,760
This is great.

112
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:42,720
I just love it here so much.

113
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:44,320
Pretty Sis.

114
00:06:45,520 --> 00:06:48,240
You came this time to take Hao Ruichi back, didn't you?

115
00:06:48,320 --> 00:06:48,840
What? Are you reluctant?

116
00:06:48,960 --> 00:06:49,720
So,

117
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:53,880
if he goes back,

118
00:06:54,400 --> 00:06:55,600
can he come back again?

119
00:06:55,680 --> 00:06:56,920
No, he can't.

120
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:00,080
But don't worry.

121
00:07:06,080 --> 00:07:07,040
As long as he doesn't request it himself,

122
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:08,360
I won't take him away.

123
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:09,640
Really?

124
00:07:10,280 --> 00:07:10,920
After all, he's my only brother.

125
00:07:11,200 --> 00:07:13,000
I still want to respect his wishes.

126
00:07:13,120 --> 00:07:14,600
Can I have another bowl?

127
00:07:17,160 --> 00:07:18,080
No problem.

128
00:07:18,440 --> 00:07:19,080
Miaomiao.

129
00:07:29,040 --> 00:07:29,640
I told you,

130
00:07:30,160 --> 00:07:30,840
don't challenge my bottom line.

131
00:07:31,680 --> 00:07:33,440
Are you sure you're completely okay now?

132
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:36,080
Yes, I'm really fine now.

133
00:07:36,600 --> 00:07:37,400
But seriously, what happened?

134
00:07:38,280 --> 00:07:39,760
My sister agreed to let me stay.

135
00:07:40,840 --> 00:07:42,440
She gave me her crystal.

136
00:07:42,840 --> 00:07:44,120
Now,

137
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:45,120
I can live freely here.

138
00:07:45,200 --> 00:07:47,280
It's all settled.

139
00:07:47,880 --> 00:07:48,640
Really?

140
00:07:49,880 --> 00:07:50,560
That's great!

141
00:07:50,640 --> 00:07:51,960
I told you, I'm the luckiest!

142
00:08:00,400 --> 00:08:01,480
Thank you, sis!

143
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:03,560
What can I do?

144
00:08:03,680 --> 00:08:05,280
The younger brother outpowers the elder sister, huh?

145
00:08:08,560 --> 00:08:09,440
But pretty sis,

146
00:08:09,960 --> 00:08:12,240
are you sure you’re okay with leaving the crystal here?

147
00:08:13,320 --> 00:08:14,240
No problem.

148
00:08:14,320 --> 00:08:16,440
This useless rock, we have plenty of them on Lan Kexing.

149
00:08:17,520 --> 00:08:18,080
That's great!

150
00:08:18,160 --> 00:08:19,840
I have to tell this to Jane and the others.

151
00:08:24,960 --> 00:08:27,240
She’s really both silly and adorable.

152
00:08:35,760 --> 00:08:37,040
Do you think this is truly worth it?

153
00:08:38,680 --> 00:08:39,360
Yes, it is.

154
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:42,680
If it makes her happy, it's worth it.

155
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:51,400
What is it? Are you looking for me?

156
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:52,840
Sis,

157
00:08:54,920 --> 00:08:55,600
can you do me a favor?

158
00:08:58,840 --> 00:08:59,480
What kind of favor?

159
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:02,680
How much longer can I stay here?

160
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:04,880
How long do you think you can survive here?

161
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:07,920
Do you know,

162
00:09:08,080 --> 00:09:09,480
living is the most important thing of all?

163
00:09:13,560 --> 00:09:14,920
Before I came here,

164
00:09:16,280 --> 00:09:17,360
I used to think the same way.

165
00:09:18,320 --> 00:09:19,480
But then I met her.

166
00:09:21,240 --> 00:09:22,960
She showed me what joy is.

167
00:09:23,960 --> 00:09:25,080
What sadness is.

168
00:09:26,760 --> 00:09:27,920
What happiness is.

169
00:09:31,280 --> 00:09:31,960
Here,

170
00:09:33,200 --> 00:09:34,320
my name is Hao Ruichi.

171
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:36,040
I am someone with life,

172
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:38,520
a living person with emotions.

173
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:39,840
So,

174
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:42,680
even if it's just one day,

175
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:45,520
I will choose to stay.

176
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:47,240
If you choose to stay here,

177
00:09:48,680 --> 00:09:50,280
you won’t have even a month left.
